  <body>
    <sec id="sec1">
      <title>Introduction</title>
      <p>This article demonstrates the floats-group element, which is used to contain figures, tables, and boxed text that appear at the end of the article rather than inline with the text. See <xref ref-type="fig" rid="fig1">Figure 1</xref>, <xref ref-type="table" rid="tbl1">Table 1</xref>, and <xref ref-type="boxed-text" rid="box1">Box 1</xref>.</p>
    </sec>
    <sec id="sec2">
      <title>Methods</title>
      <p>Standard laboratory protocols were followed as outlined in <xref ref-type="boxed-text" rid="box2">Box 2</xref>. Results are presented in <xref ref-type="fig" rid="fig2">Figure 2</xref> and <xref ref-type="table" rid="tbl2">Table 2</xref>.</p>
    </sec>
    <sec id="sec3">
      <title>Results</title>
      <p>The experimental outcomes demonstrated significant effects across all measured parameters. Detailed statistical analyses are provided in the supplementary materials.</p>
    </sec>
    <sec id="sec4">
      <title>Discussion</title>
      <p>Our findings support the hypothesis and are consistent with previous studies. The chemical structures are shown in <xref ref-type="fig" rid="chem1">Chemical Structure 1</xref>.</p>
    </sec>
  </body>
